an households.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/01/russia-says-massive-drone-attack-targeted-industrial-enterprise-amid-reports-oil-refinery-","published":"2026-11-01"},{"id":"n2","cat":"Major","title":"FBI blames North Korea's TraderTraitor for $6.3B Binance hack","summary":"The FBI attributed the roughly $6.3 billion theft from Binance's hot wallets to North Korean hackers linked to the Lazarus Group. Binance says it has covered about 90% of the losses and is resuming withdrawals in phases.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/01/fbi-blames-north-korea-for-63-billion-binance-crypto-hack","published":"2026-11-01"},{"id":"n3","cat":"World","title":"Bulgaria votes in tight presidential runoff split over Russia","summary":"Incumbent Iliana Iotova, who favours dialogue with Moscow, faces pro-Western challenger Andrey Gyurov after leading the first round with about 35% and a margin of roughly 43,000 votes.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/01/bulgarians-head-to-the-polls-in-tense-presidential-runoff","published":"2026-11-01"},{"id":"n4","cat":"Business","title":"Alphabet loses $758B in October, its worst month ever","summary":"Alphabet shares fell nearly 19% in October, their worst month since the 2004 IPO, including a record weekly loss of about $468 billion after Q3 results fuelled AI-spending fears.","source":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/article/alphabets-october-wipeout-hits-758-billion-its-worst-month-ever-211521791.html","published":"2026-10-30"},{"id":"n5","cat":"Canada","title":"Elections Alberta says 2027 vote may need delay over new ridings","summary":"Chief electoral officer Gordon McClure recommended the October 2027 election either use current boundaries or be postponed, as the NDP accuses the government of gerrymandering; Premier Smith denies it.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12128904/possible-delayed-albert-election/","published":"2026-10-31"},{"id":"n6","cat":"AI","title":"Alibaba's Qwen to power Apple Intelligence in China","summary":"Qwen will run Siri, Writing Tools and Visual Intelligence features for Chinese users, with a developer beta from Nov. 4 and a public rollout in iOS 27.3 in December. Alibaba says it won't train on user requests.","source":"CGTN","url":"https://news.cgtn.com/news/2026-10-31/Alibaba-s-Qwen-to-integrate-into-Apple-Intelligence-in-landmark-deal-1RHilSeJsbK/p.html","published":"2026-10-31"},{"id":"n7","cat":"World","title":"UN demands probe after staffer dies in Houthi custody in Yemen","summary":"UN rights chief Volker T\u00fcrk called for an urgent investigation into the death of Mohammad el Shami, detained since June 2024. Yemen's PM says more than 70 UN staff remain held by the Houthis.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/01/un-demands-investigation-after-death-of-staff-member-held-in-houthi-custody-in-yemen","published":"2026-11-01"},{"id":"n8","cat":"Canada","title":"Canada echoes U.S. warning of 'mass casualty' threat in Moscow","summary":"Global Affairs Canada repeated a U.S. Embassy alert about a credible threat at Moscow's Tsaritsyno Museum Reserve and advised Canadians in Russia to consider leaving.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12128764/mass-casualty-threat-russia/","published":"2026-10-31"},{"id":"n9","cat":"Business","title":"Memory chipmakers out-earn U.S. tech giants for first time","summary":"Five leading memory suppliers posted higher combined operating and net profit last quarter than five big U.S. tech firms, as AI demand outpaces chip supply.","source":"Nikkei Asia","url":"https://asia.nikkei.com/business/tech/semiconductors/memory-chip-makers-outearn-alphabet-other-tech-giants-on-ai-demand","published":"2026-10-31"},{"id":"n10","cat":"AI","title":"Judge lets NAACP lawsuit over xAI data centre pollution proceed","summary":"A federal judge denied xAI's motion to dismiss a Clean Air Ac